/E (             The ReservePro System Policy Handbook provides guidelines and operational policies for the ReservePro Room Booking Management System. The system is designed to help users easily search, book, and manage room reservations for apartments, hotels, and other accommodation facilities through a web-based platform. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
